      <section id = "section_margin_bt" class="jumbotron text-center">
         <div class="container">
            <h1 class="jumbotron-heading service_text_align">Meet Dental Team</h1>
         </div>
         <div class="album py-5">
            <div class="container">
               <div class="row">

                  <div class="col-lg">
                     <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <img src="images/employee01.jpg" alt="Dr. Xuyu Zhang" width="100%">
                        <div id="profile01" class="card-body">
                           <h6 class="about_title_weight">Doris</h6>
                           <p class="about_side_title_color">Principal Dentist </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              Dr. Xuyu Zhang is a graduate of the UCSF School of Dentistry who believes that a healthy
                              mouth is the cornerstone to not only a beautiful smile, but good health overall. Under
                              Dr. Zhang's care, everyone is given special attention and allowed to address individual
                              concerns/cases; no two patients are alike.
                           </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              Dr Zhang immigrated to the United States from China at 15 years old. He received his
                              bachelor's degree in Biology from Occidental College in Los Angeles. He loves being a
                              dentist. He is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="col-lg">
                     <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <img src="images/employee03.jpg" alt="Dr. Xuyu Zhang" width="100%">
                        <div id="profile02" class="card-body">
                           <h6 class="about_title_weight">Doris</h6>
                           <p class="about_side_title_color">Manager, RDA</p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              Fluent in both English and Mandarin, Doris enjoys meeting new people and helping our
                              patients achieve best oral health health possible. What most patients love about Doris
                              is her welcoming and cheerful smile that becomes contagious to everyone around her.
                           </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              When she isn’t working, Doris loves spending time cooking and finding good foods to try.
                              Get to know more about Doris when you visit us for your next appointment. She looks
                              forward to welcoming you to our practice.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="col-lg">
                     <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <img src="images/employee04.jpg" alt="Dr. Xuyu Zhang" width="100%">
                        <div id="profile03" class="card-body">
                           <h6 class="about_title_weight">Joanne</h6>
                           <p class="about_side_title_color">Dental Assistant, RDA</p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              Joanne enjoys all aspect of her work, but is especially prideful when it comes to
                              helping patients experience the best possible care and seem them leave happy and
                              smiling. She is very attentive and always try her best to cater to every patient’s need.
                           </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              At her free time, Joanne likes to read and practice yoga.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="col-lg">
                     <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <img src="images/employee06.jpg" alt="Dr. Xuyu Zhang" width="100%">
                        <div id="profile04" class="card-body">
                           <h6 class="about_title_weight">William Yan</h6>
                           <p class="about_side_title_color">Front Desk Receptionist </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              William loves meeting new patients and strives to provide excellent service to patients. He enjoys communicating with patients to understand their needs and helping them with their concerns.
                           </p>
                           <p class="about_para_size about_left">
                              William can speak fluent English, Cantonese, and a little bit of Mandarin. During his free time, William likes to watch sports and playing basketball.
                           </p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
